# Una vez por dia: baja las velas 1m nuevas, exporta los dias cerrados a data/export y los sube a Drive
# (HEATSIGNAL_DRIVE_REMOTE en .env). El "-" en ReadWritePaths tolera que rclone no este configurado.
[Unit]
Description=HeatSignal history: velas 1m nuevas, export diario y respaldo a Drive
After=network-online.target
Wants=network-online.target

[Service]
Type=oneshot
User=nahue
WorkingDirectory=/home/nahue/heatsignal/backend
EnvironmentFile=-/home/nahue/heatsignal/.env
Environment=PYTHONPATH=/home/nahue/heatsignal/backend/src
Environment=HEATSIGNAL_HISTORY_DB=/home/nahue/heatsignal/data/heatsignal_history.sqlite
Environment=HEATSIGNAL_EXPORT_DIR=/home/nahue/heatsignal/data/export
ExecStart=/home/nahue/heatsignal/backend/.venv/bin/python -m heatsignal.history.klines --update
ExecStart=/home/nahue/heatsignal/backend/.venv/bin/python -m heatsignal.history.export
MemoryMax=300M
Nice=10
ProtectSystem=strict
# rclone renueva el token de Drive y lo reescribe en su config
ReadWritePaths=/home/nahue/heatsignal -/home/nahue/.config/rclone
PrivateTmp=true
NoNewPrivileges=true
